# REQUIRES: verilator
# (11-08: the runs pin --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct, the defaults before then, so that the
# link counts and registers checked below stay those of the feature under test.)
# Paged links (`--link-kinds <producer>:<reader>:<kind>:<p>`): an early link,
# its reader input's only source, in block or ultra RAM as p rows an entry of
# a p-th of its bits; the producer's and the reader's passes p apart (their
# link ports), the write a page a host cycle over the p after the pass, the
# reader's gather over the p + 1 before its slot. Exact against the target,
# channels stalled or not, with bubbles. A link whose write lands too close
# to its read (Reader -> Unit at p 3: 3 host cycles) stays unpaged.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/linkpage
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p2 --static --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct --nest --modulo --link-block-depth 2 --link-kinds Unit:Reader:block:2,Reader:Unit:ultra:3 Unit Reader 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P2
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P2USE < %t/p2/schedule.txt
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/p2/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/p2/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p2/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+1 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/p2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+2 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p4 --static --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct --nest --modulo --bubbles --link-block-depth 2 --link-kinds Unit:Reader:block:4,Reader:Unit:block:2 Unit Reader 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P4
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/p4/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/p4/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p4/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+3 +bubble=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/p4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+4 +bubble=50 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/p4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+5 +bubble=30 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: not foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/bad --static --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct --nest --modulo --link-kinds Unit:Reader:distributed:2 Unit Reader 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BAD
# P2: II = 12
# P2: paged: 1 links, 64 flops
# P2: link kinds: distributed 0 0 0; block 6 1536 3.0; ultra 1 256 1
# P2: paged 1
# P2USE: link use Reader Unit 32 8 4 ultra 1 3 3 3 4 1 1 4 4 0
# P2USE: link use Unit Reader 32 8 4 block 1 3 3 12 4 1 1 4 4 2
# P4: II = 16
# P4: paged 1
# BAD: link-kinds: 'Unit:Reader:distributed:2' is not
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
